               Recheck Cond: (x = 1)
               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on wa_x
                     Index Cond: (x = 1)
(8 rows)

EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM wa RIGHT JOIN wb ON wa.id = wb.id WHERE wa.x = 1;
                 QUERY PLAN                  
---------------------------------------------
 Hash Join
   Hash Cond: (wb.id = wa.id)
   ->  Seq Scan on wb
   ->  Hash
         ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on wa
               Recheck Cond: (x = 1)
               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on wa_x
                     Index Cond: (x = 1)
(8 rows)

